This handoff does not include a generated uv.lock because the execution container could not resolve github.com or Python package indexes.

Generate and commit the lock on a machine with network access:

  nix develop .#default
  uv lock
  git add uv.lock
  git commit --amend --no-edit

Then use the same lock in both environments:

  # Laptop / CPU LSP environment
  uv sync --frozen --extra cpu --group dev

  # GPU server environment
  uv sync --frozen --extra cuda --group dev

The project declares cpu and cuda extras as conflicting, so sync exactly one of them at a time.
